# Design guard tests read this file's source text and pattern-match it —
# src/design/tokens.guard.test.ts finds each theme with
# /html\[data-theme="([^"]+)"\]/. Prettier formats CSS with single quotes
# (singleQuote: true), which turns those selectors into
# html[data-theme='dark'] and the guards then match nothing, so 29 assertions
# in tokens.guard / themeContrast / spineContrast / codeSurfaces go red.
# Formatted CSS and source-shape guards cannot both hold here; the guards win.
# Making those matchers quote-agnostic is what would lift this exclusion.
